- [ ] CSS variables defined at `:root` level
- [ ] Google Fonts loaded (Poppins 700, Lora 400)
- [ ] All headings use `--font-heading` (Poppins)
- [ ] All body text uses `--font-body` (Lora)
- [ ] Dark sections use `--brand-light` text
- [ ] Accent cycling applied to cards, charts, borders, stat colors
