{"language": "markdown", "code": "# Brand Styling — HTML Artifacts & React Components

Read this file when creating HTML artifacts, React components, or any web-based output
that should use brand styling.

---

## CSS variables (include in every branded artifact)

```css
:root {
  --brand-dark:       #141413;
  --brand-light:      #faf9f5;
  --brand-mid-gray:   #b0aea5;
  --brand-light-gray: #e8e6dc;
  --brand-orange:     #d97757;
  --brand-blue:       #6a9bcc;
  --brand-green:      #788c5d;

  /* Semantic aliases */
  --color-bg:         var(--brand-light);
  --color-bg-subtle:  var(--brand-light-gray);
  --color-text:       var(--brand-dark);
  --color-text-muted: var(--brand-mid-gray);
  --color-accent-1:   var(--brand-orange);
  --color-accent-2:   var(--brand-blue);
  --color-accent-3:   var(--brand-green);

  /* Typography */
  --font-heading: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-body:    'Lora', Georgia, serif;
}
```

---

## Font loading (HTML artifacts)

```html
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@600;700&family=Lora:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

---

## Base typography CSS

```css
body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  color: var(--color-text);
  background-color: var(--color-bg);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--color-text);
  line-height: 1.2;
}

h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; }

p, li, td { font-family: var(--font-body); color: var(--color-text); }

.text-muted  { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.text-light  { color: var(--brand-light); }
```

---

## Component patterns

### Dark header / hero
```css
.header-dark {
  background-color: var(--brand-dark);
  color: var(--brand-light);
  padding: 2rem;
}
.header-dark h1, .header-dark h2 {
  color: var(--brand-light);
}
```

### Accent card (cycle index 0/1/2 → orange/blue/green)
```css
.card-accent-0 { border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-orange); }
.card-accent-1 { border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-blue); }
.card-accent-2 { border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-green); }

.card {
  background: var(--color-bg);
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 1.25rem;
}
```

### Table
```css
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: var(--font-body); }
thead tr { background-color: var(--brand-orange); }   /* or BLUE/GREEN by index */
thead th { color: var(--brand-light); font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; text-align: left; }
tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: var(--brand-light-gray); }
tbody tr:nth-child(odd)  { background-color: var(--brand-light); }
tbody td { padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem; color: var(--brand-dark); }
```

### Stat callout
```css
.stat {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--brand-orange);  /* or blue/green */
}
.stat-label {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
```

---

## React / Tailwind

Tailwind doesn't have brand tokens by default. Use inline styles or a style object:

```jsx
const BRAND = {
  dark:      '#141413',
  light:     '#faf9f5',
  midGray:   '#b0aea5',
  lightGray: '#e8e6dc',
  orange:    '#d97757',
  blue:      '#6a9bcc',
  green:     '#788c5d',
};
const ACCENTS = [BRAND.orange, BRAND.blue, BRAND.green];

// Heading
<h2 style={{ fontFamily: "'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif", fontWeight: 700, color: BRAND.dark }}>
  Section Title
</h2>

// Body
<p style={{ fontFamily: "'Lora', Georgia, serif", color: BRAND.dark }}>
  Body copy here.
</p>

// Accent card
<div style={{ borderLeft: `4px solid ${ACCENTS[i % 3]}`, background: BRAND.light, padding: '1rem' }}>
  ...
</div>
```

---

## QA checklist

- [ ] CSS variables defined at `:root` level
- [ ] Google Fonts loaded (Poppins 700, Lora 400)
- [ ] All headings use `--font-heading` (Poppins)
- [ ] All body text uses `--font-body` (Lora)
- [ ] Dark sections use `--brand-light` text
- [ ] Accent cycling applied to cards, charts, borders, stat colors
- [ ] No pure `#000` or `#fff` — use brand Dark/Light tokens
