input.file_text:
# HTML / Web / React Design Reference

Read this file whenever producing HTML artifacts, React components, CSS-based layouts,
interactive dashboards, or any web output.

---

## Pre-Build Design Interrogation Checklist

Before writing code:
- [ ] What is the visual register? (Technical, editorial, consumer, data-dense)
- [ ] What's the one design idea this will execute? (State it in a sentence)
- [ ] What design reference am I drawing from? (Stripe, Linear, NYT, Apple — pick one)
- [ ] What are the 5 color roles? (bg, surface, border, text-primary, accent)
- [ ] What is the type pairing? (Display + body, or single-family with weight contrast)
- [ ] What is the base spacing unit? (8px recommended)
- [ ] What interactions exist, and do they deserve animation?

---

## CSS Foundation (always use)

```css
/* 1. Define all tokens as custom properties */
:root {
  /* Surfaces */
  --bg:          #0f172a;     /* example dark mode */
  --surface:     #1e293b;
  --surface-2:   #263348;
  --border:      rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

  /* Text */
  --text-primary:  #f8fafc;
  --text-muted:    #94a3b8;
  --text-disabled: #475569;

  /* Accent — ONE intentional color */
  --accent:        #6366f1;  /* example indigo */
  --accent-muted:  rgba(99,102,241,0.12);

  /* Spacing */
  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 16px;
  --space-4: 24px;
  --space-5: 32px;
  --space-6: 48px;
  --space-7: 64px;

  /* Typography */
  --font-display: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif;  /* example — choose deliberately */
  --font-body:    'Geist', 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-mono:    'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;

  /* Type scale */
  --text-xs:   0.75rem;   /* 12px */
  --text-sm:   0.875rem;  /* 14px */
  --text-base: 1rem;      /* 16px */
  --text-lg:   1.125rem;  /* 18px */
  --text-xl:   1.25rem;   /* 20px */
  --text-2xl:  1.5rem;    /* 24px */
  --text-3xl:  1.875rem;  /* 30px */
  --text-4xl:  2.25rem;   /* 36px */
  --text-5xl:  3rem;      /* 48px */

  /* Radii */
  --radius-sm:  4px;
  --radius-md:  8px;
  --radius-lg:  12px;
  --radius-xl:  16px;
  --radius-full: 9999px;

  /* Shadows */
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.12), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

/* 2. Always reset box-sizing */
*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

/* 3. Body baseline */
body {
  background-color: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  line-height: 1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

/* 4. Typography defaults */
h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  line-height: 1.2;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

/* Tracked labels */
.label {
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

/* Numbers */
.metric, td {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
```

---

## Layout Patterns

### Dashboard Grid
```css
.dashboard {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: var(--space-4);
  padding: var(--space-6);
}
```

### KPI Card
```css
.kpi-card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: var(--space-5);
  border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);  /* colored top border technique */
}

.kpi-value {
  font-size: var(--text-5xl);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  line-height: 1;
}
```

### Table with Data Design
```css
table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
}

thead tr {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

th {
  /* tracked label style */
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
  text-align: left;
}

th:is(:nth-child(2), :nth-child(3)) {
  text-align: right;
}

td {
  padding: var(--space-3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  vertical-align: middle;
}

td:is(:nth-child(2), :nth-child(3)) {
  text-align: right;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

tbody tr:last-child td {
  border-bottom: none;
  font-weight: 600;  /* total/summary row */
}

tbody tr:hover td {
  background: var(--surface-2);
}
```

---

## Font Loading (Google Fonts CDN)

Choose deliberately. Options by register:

**Technical / SaaS**:
```html
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

**Editorial / Warm**:
```html
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

**Swiss / Structural**:
```html
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

**Confident / Bold**:
```html
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,700;1,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

---

## Animation Guidelines

**Earn every animation.** Not everything needs to move.

### When to animate:
- Page/component load state transitions (entrance)
- Data updates (number changes, chart rendering)
- Hover states on interactive elements
- State changes (loading → loaded, empty → filled)

### When NOT to animate:
- Text content rendering (just show it)
- Static displays with no interaction
- Every element entering the viewport (visual noise)

### Animation tokens:
```css
:root {
  --ease-out:    cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  --ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);
  --duration-fast:   150ms;
  --duration-base:   250ms;
  --duration-slow:   400ms;
}
```

### Entrance pattern (staggered):
```css
@keyframes fadeUp {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.card {
  animation: fadeUp var(--duration-slow) var(--ease-out) both;
}
.card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 60ms; }
.card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 120ms; }
.card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 180ms; }
```

---

## Common Anti-Patterns to Avoid

| Anti-pattern | Better approach |
|---|---|
| `font-family: Inter, sans-serif` as default | Choose deliberately; justify the choice |
| `background: white; color: black` | Use your token system; never pure #000/#fff |
| `box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px grey` | Use a layered shadow system (see above) |
| Random margin/padding values | All spacing = multiples of 8 (or 4) |
| Chart with legend box | Label data directly (annotation > legend) |
| 3D or pie charts | Bar, line, scatter, small multiples instead |
| `display: flex; justify-content: center` everywhere | Design for information, not centering |
| Color every element differently | 60% neutral, 30% secondary, 10% accent |
| `font-size: 14px` for everything | Establish a type scale; use it |
| No hover states | Every interactive element needs a hover |

