content.text:
  1	# HTML / Web / React Design Reference
  2	
  3	Read this file whenever producing HTML artifacts, React components, CSS-based layouts,
  4	interactive dashboards, or any web output.
  5	
  6	---
  7	
  8	## Pre-Build Design Interrogation Checklist
  9	
 10	Before writing code:
 11	- [ ] What is the visual register? (Technical, editorial, consumer, data-dense)
 12	- [ ] What's the one design idea this will execute? (State it in a sentence)
 13	- [ ] What design reference am I drawing from? (Stripe, Linear, NYT, Apple — pick one)
 14	- [ ] What are the 5 color roles? (bg, surface, border, text-primary, accent)
 15	- [ ] What is the type pairing? (Display + body, or single-family with weight contrast)
 16	- [ ] What is the base spacing unit? (8px recommended)
 17	- [ ] What interactions exist, and do they deserve animation?
 18	
 19	---
 20	
 21	## CSS Foundation (always use)
 22	
 23	```css
 24	/* 1. Define all tokens as custom properties */
 25	:root {
 26	  /* Surfaces */
 27	  --bg:          #0f172a;     /* example dark mode */
 28	  --surface:     #1e293b;
 29	  --surface-2:   #263348;
 30	  --border:      rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
 31	
 32	  /* Text */
 33	  --text-primary:  #f8fafc;
 34	  --text-muted:    #94a3b8;
 35	  --text-disabled: #475569;
 36	
 37	  /* Accent — ONE intentional color */
 38	  --accent:        #6366f1;  /* example indigo */
 39	  --accent-muted:  rgba(99,102,241,0.12);
 40	
 41	  /* Spacing */
 42	  --space-1: 4px;
 43	  --space-2: 8px;
 44	  --space-3: 16px;
 45	  --space-4: 24px;
 46	  --space-5: 32px;
 47	  --space-6: 48px;
 48	  --space-7: 64px;
 49	
 50	  /* Typography */
 51	  --font-display: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif;  /* example — choose deliberately */
 52	  --font-body:    'Geist', 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
 53	  --font-mono:    'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', monospace;
 54	
 55	  /* Type scale */
 56	  --text-xs:   0.75rem;   /* 12px */
 57	  --text-sm:   0.875rem;  /* 14px */
 58	  --text-base: 1rem;      /* 16px */
 59	  --text-lg:   1.125rem;  /* 18px */
 60	  --text-xl:   1.25rem;   /* 20px */
 61	  --text-2xl:  1.5rem;    /* 24px */
 62	  --text-3xl:  1.875rem;  /* 30px */
 63	  --text-4xl:  2.25rem;   /* 36px */
 64	  --text-5xl:  3rem;      /* 48px */
 65	
 66	  /* Radii */
 67	  --radius-sm:  4px;
 68	  --radius-md:  8px;
 69	  --radius-lg:  12px;
 70	  --radius-xl:  16px;
 71	  --radius-full: 9999px;
 72	
 73	  /* Shadows */
 74	  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.12), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
 75	  --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
 76	  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.18), 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
 77	}
 78	
 79	/* 2. Always reset box-sizing */
 80	*, *::before, *::after {
 81	  box-sizing: border-box;
 82	  margin: 0;
 83	  padding: 0;
 84	}
 85	
 86	/* 3. Body baseline */
 87	body {
 88	  background-color: var(--bg);
 89	  color: var(--text-primary);
 90	  font-family: var(--font-body);
 91	  font-size: var(--text-base);
 92	  line-height: 1.6;
 93	  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
 94	  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
 95	}
 96	
 97	/* 4. Typography defaults */
 98	h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
 99	  font-family: var(--font-display);
100	  line-height: 1.2;
101	  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
102	}
103	
104	/* Tracked labels */
105	.label {
106	  font-size: var(--text-xs);
107	  font-weight: 500;
108	  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
109	  text-transform: uppercase;
110	  color: var(--text-muted);
111	}
112	
113	/* Numbers */
114	.metric, td {
115	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
116	  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
117	}
118	```
119	
120	---
121	
122	## Layout Patterns
123	
124	### Dashboard Grid
125	```css
126	.dashboard {
127	  display: grid;
128	  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
129	  gap: var(--space-4);
130	  padding: var(--space-6);
131	}
132	```
133	
134	### KPI Card
135	```css
136	.kpi-card {
137	  background: var(--surface);
138	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
139	  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
140	  padding: var(--space-5);
141	  border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);  /* colored top border technique */
142	}
143	
144	.kpi-value {
145	  font-size: var(--text-5xl);
146	  font-weight: 700;
147	  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
148	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
149	  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
150	  line-height: 1;
151	}
152	```
153	
154	### Table with Data Design
155	```css
156	table {
157	  width: 100%;
158	  border-collapse: collapse;
159	  font-size: var(--text-sm);
160	}
161	
162	thead tr {
163	  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
164	}
165	
166	th {
167	  /* tracked label style */
168	  font-size: var(--text-xs);
169	  font-weight: 500;
170	  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
171	  text-transform: uppercase;
172	  color: var(--text-muted);
173	  padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
174	  text-align: left;
175	}
176	
177	th:is(:nth-child(2), :nth-child(3)) {
178	  text-align: right;
179	}
180	
181	td {
182	  padding: var(--space-3);
183	  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
184	  vertical-align: middle;
185	}
186	
187	td:is(:nth-child(2), :nth-child(3)) {
188	  text-align: right;
189	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
190	  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
191	}
192	
193	tbody tr:last-child td {
194	  border-bottom: none;
195	  font-weight: 600;  /* total/summary row */
196	}
197	
198	tbody tr:hover td {
199	  background: var(--surface-2);
200	}
201	```
202	
203	---
204	
205	## Font Loading (Google Fonts CDN)
206	
207	Choose deliberately. Options by register:
208	
209	**Technical / SaaS**:
210	```html
211	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
212	```
213	
214	**Editorial / Warm**:
215	```html
216	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
217	```
218	
219	**Swiss / Structural**:
220	```html
221	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
222	```
223	
224	**Confident / Bold**:
225	```html
226	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,700;1,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
227	```
228	
229	---
230	
231	## Animation Guidelines
232	
233	**Earn every animation.** Not everything needs to move.
234	
235	### When to animate:
236	- Page/component load state transitions (entrance)
237	- Data updates (number changes, chart rendering)
238	- Hover states on interactive elements
239	- State changes (loading → loaded, empty → filled)
240	
241	### When NOT to animate:
242	- Text content rendering (just show it)
243	- Static displays with no interaction
244	- Every element entering the viewport (visual noise)
245	
246	### Animation tokens:
247	```css
248	:root {
249	  --ease-out:    cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
250	  --ease-in-out: cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1);
251	  --duration-fast:   150ms;
252	  --duration-base:   250ms;
253	  --duration-slow:   400ms;
254	}
255	```
256	
257	### Entrance pattern (staggered):
258	```css
259	@keyframes fadeUp {
260	  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
261	  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
262	}
263	
264	.card {
265	  animation: fadeUp var(--duration-slow) var(--ease-out) both;
266	}
267	.card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 60ms; }
268	.card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 120ms; }
269	.card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 180ms; }
270	```
271	
272	---
273	
274	## Common Anti-Patterns to Avoid
275	
276	| Anti-pattern | Better approach |
277	|---|---|
278	| `font-family: Inter, sans-serif` as default | Choose deliberately; justify the choice |
279	| `background: white; color: black` | Use your token system; never pure #000/#fff |
280	| `box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px grey` | Use a layered shadow system (see above) |
281	| Random margin/padding values | All spacing = multiples of 8 (or 4) |
282	| Chart with legend box | Label data directly (annotation > legend) |
283	| 3D or pie charts | Bar, line, scatter, small multiples instead |
284	| `display: flex; justify-content: center` everywhere | Design for information, not centering |
285	| Color every element differently | 60% neutral, 30% secondary, 10% accent |
286	| `font-size: 14px` for everything | Establish a type scale; use it |
287	| No hover states | Every interactive element needs a hover |
288

